0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.6,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Kanji-OPı,Duality,32,&H00D8933F,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.6,0,8,10,10,65,1Style: Kanji-furigana-OPı,Duality,18,&H00D8933F,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601PlayResX: 640PlayResY: 480Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.87,0:24:12.88,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,You gonna take this katana, too?Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.03,0:25:42.67,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,You're lucky you were born as a boy, Zoro.Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.93,0:27:02.77,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,Some things cannot be stopped.Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.77,0:27:05.51,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,The tides of time,Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.51,0:27:08.68,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,humanity's dreams and inherited will...Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.68,0:27:11.73,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,As long as people seek freedom,Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.73,0:27:14.48,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,these things will never cease to be.Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Ah! That was fun!Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:11.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:15.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Nami?Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The air has changed...Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:18.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Air?Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's gonna rain.Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:21.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh? When the weather is this nice?Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:23.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:26.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone's on the execution platform!Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.35,0:00:27.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is that?Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:34.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That old man said that the pirate king died here 22 years ago.Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:35.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He showed up?!Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:38.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes! We were watching the square like you told us,Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:40.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,and the guy from the wanted poster just showed up...Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:41.60,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's go flashily.Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:01:03.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wow! So this is what the pirate king saw.Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:07.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Please wait... Captain Smoker!Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:09.92,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Come along, Tashigi.Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:06.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey, you over there!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:09.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Come down right away!Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:11.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:15.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's a special execution platform owned by the World Government!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.69,0:03:17.92,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Come down right now!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:24.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Now's not the time for small fries.Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.69,0:03:25.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:29.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you, Luffy. Long time no see...Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:38.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten my face.Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:40.98,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,How pretty!Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:42.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,She's stunning!Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.01,0:03:43.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,She is a woman of unrivaled beauty!Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:46.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Her skin looks so smooth.Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:51.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone like you. Who are you?Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:57.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you because you're the first man who hit me.Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:03:59.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What? I hit you?Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:05.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,When your passionate fist struck me...Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:10.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh, it felt indescribable!Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:20.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey... who's the most beautiful in the East Blue?Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:23.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That'd be you!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:25.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's right. It's me.Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.43,0:04:30.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There's no man in this world that doesn't bow before my beauty.Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:33.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,And I like strong men.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.93,0:04:37.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'll make you mine, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:40.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Shut up! No way! Who the heck are you?Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:42.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You still haven't figured it out?Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:46.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This is the police! Come quietly, lady!Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:50.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest for battery against the police captain!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:53.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,And you over there! Get off the  execution platform already!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:57.02,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh? Who'd you say you'd arrest?Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:05:00.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain, this is a problem! She's beautiful!Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:02.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So what?! Should we arrest her?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:05.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But she's so dazzling!Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:07.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Surprise!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:10.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A terrorist bombing!!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:11.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's heading straight for her!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:16.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the...Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The fountain slipped!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:20.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What just happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:26.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That was dangerous, you know.Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.17,0:05:31.32,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Flashily sorry. But your smooth skin  is unharmed, of course.Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:32.14,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So no harm done...Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:35.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,fairest Alvida.Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:37.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh? Alvida?Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I don't see Alvida.Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:45.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm Alvida! You blockhead!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:48.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Really? You don't look like her at all...Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:53.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I changed a bit after eating a devil fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.17,0:05:54.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The name of the fruit is...Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.66,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,the Smooth Smooth Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:06:02.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No attack can hurt my skin because it slides off it.Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:07.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, my beauty couldn't be improved that much.Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:12.08,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The only big change was that I indeed lost my freckles.Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:14.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,N-No, that's not really what I meant.Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:16.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,After becoming a new person,Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:20.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I joined forces with him since he also wanted to find you.Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.21,0:06:33.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now, the main star can make his flashy entrance!Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:35.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.65,0:06:38.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Since the day you sent me flying,Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I've been obsessed with getting revenge on you.Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:44.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That determination fueled me until I finally found my crew.Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:48.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It was indeed a great adventure. I was missing parts of my body.Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.71,0:06:51.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It was a tale full of both laughter and tears.Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:53.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I call it "little Buggy-kun's great adventure."Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.81,0:06:55.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You see, Buggy-kun was...Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:57.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wait, why am I telling you this, you bastard?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:07:00.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What? Wait, what was your name again?Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.21,0:07:03.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Boggy? No, Boogie?  It wasn't Behie...Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.77,0:07:06.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! Buffoon!Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:12.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Buffoon?! Stop messing around!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:15.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're as irritating as ever, you moron!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:17.58,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,T-That's Buggy the Clown!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:18.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,They're p-pirates!!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:23.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's the Buggy Pirates!!Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:28.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You people stay where you are!Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:34.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you how scary I can be.Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:37.18,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right! It's Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.18,0:07:39.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You just remembered it?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:43.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:49.48,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, rubber man.  How's Roronoa Zoro doing?Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:52.36,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Okay, Cabaji. Good job.Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.91,0:07:59.12,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I ask that my hundreds of billions  of followersDialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:00.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,around the world watch closely!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:03.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We're about to host a super flashy public execution!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:09.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy! You can't move even an inch now.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:11.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You should feel honored, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:15.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You get to die in the same place as the king of the pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.23,0:08:30.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The atmospheric pressure is dropping like crazy.Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a sudden change before.Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:35.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I can feel the wind...Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:38.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A storm is gonna hit this island!Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:40.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A-A storm?Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:43.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry back to the ship or we'll be in trouble.Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.11,0:08:44.64,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Will it be a big one?Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.64,0:08:45.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey...!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:45.67,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:47.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:48.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Have you seen him?Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:50.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You mean Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:54.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Pirates're here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:56.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Pirates're here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:57.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:59.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's Buggy the Clown!!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.01,0:09:00.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:01.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Clown!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What? Then...Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:10.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.19,0:09:15.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, Buggy the Clown and Iron Club Alvida are all present.Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:20.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The square has been taken over by notorious East Blue pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:23.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Right under my nose...Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:26.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What arrogant scum.Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:29.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Captain Smoker?Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:32.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Deploy Unit #1 to the port.Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.91,0:09:35.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Unit #2 is to secretly surround the square from the side streets.Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.75,0:09:38.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,And have the rest stand by within shooting range of the square.Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:39.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's all.Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:40.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:43.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Give this order to Unit #1.Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:43.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes sir?Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:47.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,"Destroy any pirate ships as soon as you see them.Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:53.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Not a single pirate is to leave this island."Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:00.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,An execution!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,An execution is starting!Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:04.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Clown will be executing Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Luffy's gonna be executed?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.99,0:10:08.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.47,0:10:09.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:10.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Take care of this!Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:14.92,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,S-S-S-Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:17.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Treat it like a lady! Got it?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:17.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oops!Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:19.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry, too!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:21.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey, Nami! Where're we going?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:23.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The harbor, of course!Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:26.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,H-Harbor? Oh yeah, of course!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:30.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker! Please take a look.Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:32.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Things are getting weird.Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.31,0:10:33.98,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:35.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wha...! Th-That kid...Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.89,0:10:38.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:44.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy. This can't be! It looks like he's about to be killed!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:46.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain, are we swooping in right away?Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.11,0:10:47.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Idiot. Don't be hasty.Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.03,0:10:51.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A pirate is about to kill another pirate.Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:53.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,They're saving us the trouble.Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:57.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Listen! Once that Straw Hat's head rolls,Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:11:01.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,apprehend Buggy, Alvida and the rest!Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:02.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't give them time to think!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:10.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The pirate Monkey D. Luffy is going to die...Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.81,0:11:15.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,for the crime of pissing me off with his arrogance!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:20.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's do it with a bang!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.65,0:11:25.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This is my first time seeing an execution.Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.87,0:11:28.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We're executing you.Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:31.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What?! Stop joking!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.74,0:11:33.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You stop joking!Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:36.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sure, we'll get on that!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:40.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The public execution will now begin!!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:45.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!! Stop it!  I don't wanna die!!Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:48.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I just saw a big cumulus cloud in the east.Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:53.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A storm is definitely coming. It's gonna be unimaginably big...Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:58.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,If Buggy, Luffy and the others go  crazy, the marines will take action.Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.61,0:12:02.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We're done for if the ship is washed out to sea when we have to escape.Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:03.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I see. That really is a big deal!Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:07.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The marines may have already made their move.Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The Going Merry is in danger!Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:14.92,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Th-The Going Merry will end up in Navy hands?Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:18.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,C-Come on, Nami! Hurry up!!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:20.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.59,0:12:23.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hurry to the harbor!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.02,0:12:28.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Riding around on the Richie bike!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:33.44,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Who's that man? Who? Who? Who's that man?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:36.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Me!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:39.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So this is the rubber guy's ship...Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:45.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's bigger than the last ship.Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.11,0:12:49.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy is about to begin the execution.Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.11,0:12:57.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,However...! Even if there is no chance for the rubber guy to escape,Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:13:01.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,it's better to be safe and burn their ship.Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:10.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry... I won't do it again. Please forgive me.Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:11.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Like hell I will, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.07,0:13:15.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hmph! This is what happens when someone goes against us.Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:19.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I guess this is it for the man I had my eye on...Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:22.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You have a big audience;Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:25.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,do you wanna say something before you die?Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:28.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No? Well, that's okay.Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:34.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't matter anyway since you're about to die.Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:40.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:49.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wha...Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:52.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,D-Did he just say "king of the pirates?!"Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:54.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,In this town, of all places...Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.65,0:13:57.02,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's crazy...Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:14:00.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Well then, I guess this is it, you rubber twerp.Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:06.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Stop...Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:08.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,the execution!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.39,0:14:19.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's Pirate Hunter Z-Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:20.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Zoro?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:26.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So you're here, Zoro?! But you're too late!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:28.76,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We'll bring down...Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:29.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,that platform!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:32.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro...Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:36.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Guys... get them!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:38.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us!Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:40.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Alvida!Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:45.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Out of our way!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.15,0:14:57.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Not even Zoro can stop me now!Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:15:01.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This is the end of your captain!!Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.37,0:15:03.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Damn bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:11.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Listen.Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:14.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The moment Monkey D. Luffy's head rolls, we're to attack all at once.Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:19.14,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,All units. Prepare for battle.Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:20.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!!Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:24.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:26.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:31.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'm... dead.Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.51,0:15:34.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Idiot...Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't say something so stupid!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.30,0:15:38.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He smiled!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:29.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive.Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Neat.Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:37.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,H-Hey,Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,reckon that was an act of god?Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.64,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Stop talking nonsense.Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:42.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's focus on getting out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.05,0:16:45.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's just one thing after another.Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:52.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now! Corner the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:55.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah!!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:57.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Here they come!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:08.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Amazing! Amazing! It's suddenly gotten crazy!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:10.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Amazing! Ahh! Amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.75,0:17:11.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:13.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Ahhh... Z-Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:15.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be watching! We need to get out of here!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.19,0:17:20.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry back to the ship or we'll never be able to leave the island.Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:22.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to enter the Grand Line!Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:24.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What?! That's no good!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:27.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are running!Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.29,0:17:29.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Catch them!Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:30.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Go after them!Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.13,0:17:54.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain, we have to apprehend the pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:18:00.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey... have you seen a pirate who  smiled on the execution platform?Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:05.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,N-Never! Even if they're acting tough,Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.71,0:18:09.10,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,at the moment of death, they all turn pale and die in despair.Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:12.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat smiled...Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:20.32,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The pirate king smiled 22 years ago in this town...Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:23.66,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,on that execution platform.Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:33.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain...Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:36.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Where did Straw Hat go?Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:40.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He ran towards the sea, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.45,0:18:45.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's Unit #1 doing? They should've  destroyed their ship by now.Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:49.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Well... They had to return for refitting because they couldn't...Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:52.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,use gunpowder due to the sudden rain.Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.35,0:18:53.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.94,0:18:58.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A reserve unit is currently moving to attack the ship instead.Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:19:03.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker! If we let them set sail now, they'll enter the Grand Line!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.85,0:19:09.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The wind is blowing towards the west. It's a tailwind for their ship.Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:13.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Are these all coincidences?Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:19.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's as if the heavens have plans for that young man.Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:22.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurryDialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:23.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,or we'll be in trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:26.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm White Hound Smoker.Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.51,0:19:29.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,On my honor as a Navy Headquarters captain,Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.35,0:19:31.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I won't let that man leave this island!!Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:39.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's with this storm?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:42.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,If we don't leave soon, we'll be stuck here.Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.53,0:19:45.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Nami-san was right when she said we should hurry back to the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:50.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Attacking me is a waste of time.Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:55.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There isn't a man alive who can touch my smooth skin.Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.91,0:20:01.46,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,For a second there, I saw a field filled with flowers.Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:03.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,, Captain Buggy, you're alive!Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:04.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No way I'd die!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:06.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Buggy, this isn't good!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:08.60,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,They're marines from headquarters. There'll be no end to them!Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:11.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less if the marines  want to stick their nose into...Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.49,0:20:13.56,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Whose nose did you say is sticking out?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.56,0:20:15.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything like that!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.00,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What're we going to do?Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.00,0:20:22.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The rubber runt! Go after the rubber runt!Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.39,0:20:25.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Mohji and Richie should have burned down his ship by now.Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.27,0:20:27.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He can't get off of this island.Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.23,0:20:30.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We'll kick his ass as we leave this island, guys!!Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:31.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah!!Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.31,0:20:32.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Motor!!Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:34.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:36.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Part Part Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:37.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:39.67,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Igniting the bomb engine!Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:44.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Set the slope!Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:46.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes, Big Sis Alvida!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:47.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Friction-less...Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:52.64,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Smooth Smooth Tracks!Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:21:00.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't let the pirates get away!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:08.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wh... What's this smoke?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:13.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What the hell...?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.37,0:21:15.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,White Out!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.47,0:21:21.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Smoker!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.79,0:21:25.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for you, small fries!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:27.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,H-He's too strong!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:29.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So that's the power of Smoke Smoke Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.19,0:21:31.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He took down Buggy's crew in a split second...Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.37,0:21:34.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:43.10,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain! He caught us all in one fell swoop!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:45.10,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,How dare you, Smoker!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:49.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's with this annoying steel net?! Firing a weird pistol like that...Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:51.02,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's a special cage shotDialogue: 0,0:21:51.03,0:21:53.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,the Navy developed to deal with devil fruit powers.Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:54.70,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.85,0:21:59.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Bring me the Billower Bike! I'm going after Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:00.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.61,0:22:06.46,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Why did it have to start pouring down...Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.46,0:22:10.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,when we have to burn this ship down?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.18,0:22:16.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Dammit! This is bad, Richie! We can't get a fire going like this!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.03,0:22:17.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,One more time!Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.17,0:22:23.48,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Be patient, Richie! I'll feed you later.Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.25,0:22:27.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.70,0:22:29.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Mohji!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.69,0:22:32.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, the female thief.Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:36.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Go, Richie!Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.25,0:22:44.67,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Lethal Fresh Egg Star!!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.35,0:22:52.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You...Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.71,0:22:54.60,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Damn! The rain made my hand slip!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.09,0:23:01.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Richie!! You're such a...!!Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:03.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now! Let's get on the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:04.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:07.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hold it! You have to get past me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.07,0:23:10.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Mohji, the first mate of the Buggy Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.86,0:23:13.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I won't let you board this...Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:17.66,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.36,0:23:19.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Marines!Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.37,0:23:20.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This is bad!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.77,0:23:21.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Aim!Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.91,0:23:25.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.89,0:23:33.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Contact the cannon unit! We'll capture the pirate ship!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:33.72,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.72,0:23:35.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,N-N-N-Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.03,0:23:36.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.91,0:23:49.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Which direction is the sea?Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.65,0:23:53.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can't tell where we're going because of all this rain!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.11,0:23:54.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There they are!!Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.33,0:23:59.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What persistent bastards! Should we stop and fight?Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.25,0:24:00.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We don't have time.Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.25,0:24:02.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:04.92,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Who's that lady?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.89,0:24:10.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you were  Roronoa Zoro, and a pirate to boot.Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.55,0:24:18.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You... You lied to me!Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.51,0:24:22.02,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What?! What'd you do to her?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.02,0:24:24.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You just didn't ask for my name.Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.04,0:24:26.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's not like I meant to deceive you.Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.79,0:24:32.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A rogue like you can't be left to use a named blade!Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.65,0:24:35.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm going to claim your sword, the legendary Wado Ichimonji!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.73,0:24:47.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You jerk! How dare you attack a lady!Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.75,0:24:49.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead.Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.39,0:24:51.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's go.Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.31,0:24:57.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro! If you hurt the lady, I won't forgive you!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.51,0:24:58.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Chief Tashigi!Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.37,0:25:19.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can't let you have this sword no matter what.Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.45,0:25:22.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Chief Tashigi lost...Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.39,0:25:24.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The Chief Petty Officer never loses...Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.87,0:25:28.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Well, then... I'm in a hurry, so...Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.75,0:25:34.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you finishing me?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.23,0:25:37.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Is it because I'm a woman?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.01,0:25:46.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Even if men are physically stronger,Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:49.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,it's insulting not to be taken seriously because I'm a woman!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.62,0:25:52.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you don't understand that burden,Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.28,0:25:54.67,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,but I often wish I was born as a boy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.67,0:25:57.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I don't carry a sword as an accessory!Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.11,0:26:01.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I hate the fact that you even exist!Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.91,0:26:08.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Listen! Your face looks just like my friend who died a long time ago!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.77,0:26:12.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,And now you're starting to talk just like her!Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.07,0:26:14.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Stop imitating her, you copycat!Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.38,0:26:17.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What?! Grow up!Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.05,0:26:21.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I am who I am! I don't care  what your friend was like,Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.37,0:26:23.12,Main-480p,,0,0,0,, I'm the one who's been wronged here!Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.10,0:26:24.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't you think before you speak?Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.05,0:26:28.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wh-What'd you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.34,0:26:31.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I see the exit! The harbor is right there!Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.86,0:26:39.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey, who is it now?Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.21,0:26:43.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're finally here...Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.69,0:26:46.58,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.53,0:27:18.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A pirate, huh? Fine by me.Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.91,0:27:30.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm Captain Smoker.  I run Loguetown for the Navy.Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.61,0:27:32.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest.Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.50,0:27:35.92,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh? Arrest? Forget it!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.92,0:27:39.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm just about to head to the Grand Line to become king of the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.61,0:27:40.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,King of the pirates?Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.05,0:27:43.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I refuse to get arrested in a place like this!Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.82,0:27:46.18,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Then you'll have to beat me first.Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.59,0:27:48.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.87,0:27:52.02,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sanji, go on ahead. I'll be right there.Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.65,0:28:00.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.12,0:28:07.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Fire the cannons!Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.77,0:28:26.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,If we stay here any longer, the Going Merry will be sunk!Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.64,0:28:35.10,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A-Are you going to set sail? Luffy and the others aren't here yet!Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.55,0:28:38.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We don't have any other choice! It's better than sinking here!Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.75,0:28:41.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Right rudder full!Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.86,0:28:46.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Then what're we going to do about Luffy and the others?Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.62,0:28:48.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We'll pick them up later.Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.41,0:28:50.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away! Follow them!Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.79,0:28:51.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Nami-san!Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.64,0:28:53.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.91,0:28:54.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.80,0:28:57.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Nami-san, I'm back!Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.38,0:28:59.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Where're Luffy and Zoro?Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.60,0:29:02.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We'll have to pick up those damn morons later.Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.51,0:29:05.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:06.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Behind you!Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.71,0:29:14.64,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Dammit! This is endless!Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.64,0:29:16.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'll cover his back! Get closer!Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.43,0:29:20.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We can't head back because of the strong current.Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.09,0:29:21.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.10,0:29:22.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.94,0:29:24.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.79,0:29:35.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.33,0:29:47.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What?! What?! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.22,0:29:56.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I ate the Smoke Smoke Fruit. So my  body can become smoke at will.Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.59,0:30:17.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Finished already?Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.76,0:30:29.22,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.59,0:30:42.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What? Eww, that's gross!Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.01,0:30:48.70,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,White Blow!Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.16,0:30:51.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.94,0:30:55.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.15,0:31:00.46,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Get it now?  You can't enter the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.25,0:31:03.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Didn't I just tell you that?Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.17,0:31:11.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're wanted for 30 million belly?Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.39,0:31:14.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've run out of your devil's luck.Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.69,0:31:19.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure.Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.80,0:31:21.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're...Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.81,0:31:36.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on? Who's that?Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.29,0:31:40.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The government is after your head.Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.11,0:31:45.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The world is waiting for our answer.Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.59,0:32:22.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Th-This is...Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.89,0:32:27.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wh-What just happened?Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.97,0:32:32.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.05,0:32:34.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Luffy!!Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.34,0:32:35.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.83,0:32:38.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry up or the ship will drift away!Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.43,0:32:39.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.85,0:32:42.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.73,0:32:46.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wha?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.38,0:32:47.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.63,0:32:49.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling...Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.19,0:32:52.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Rocket!!Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.71,0:33:03.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Everyone...Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.17,0:33:12.00,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Gee, that sudden gust was a lucky break for us.Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.00,0:33:15.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We were able to escape because I kept calm.Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.97,0:33:17.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Where're we going now?Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.50,0:33:24.60,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's head straight to the Grand Line. How nostalgic!Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.15,0:33:41.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,If that's your decision, then go!Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.49,0:33:46.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Why? Why did you help that man... Dragon?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.43,0:33:54.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Why would I interfere with another man's voyage?Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.37,0:34:08.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Set sail! We're going after Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.27,0:34:09.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.37,0:34:12.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We're entering the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.73,0:34:16.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,B-But, Captain! This island is your post.Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.37,0:34:18.32,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the higher-ups would say if...Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.35,0:34:22.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Just tell them I don't care about their orders!Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.35,0:34:24.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you!Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.75,0:34:26.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Chief Tashigi!Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.65,0:34:29.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive Roronoa.Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.54,0:34:32.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely going to capture him!Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.83,0:34:35.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,, It feels like the ship's gonna capsize!Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.33,0:34:40.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,See that light?Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.89,0:34:42.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Is that a lighthouse?Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.37,0:34:46.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The entrance to the Grand Line is just past that guiding light.Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.85,0:34:49.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is beyond that light...Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.59,0:34:50.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What do you wanna do?Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.81,0:34:54.44,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,D-Do we have to enter during a storm like this?Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.62,0:35:07.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Okay, then!Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.97,0:35:09.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Shall we hold a launching ceremonyDialogue: 0,0:35:09.79,0:35:11.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,to commemorate entering this great sea?Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.01,0:35:11.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.96,0:35:12.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sure!Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.86,0:35:14.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.19,0:35:18.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,To find the All Blue!Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.03,0:35:21.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,To be king of the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.45,0:35:24.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,To be a master swordsman!Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.99,0:35:29.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,To draw a map of the world!Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.06,0:35:35.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,T-To be a brave warrior of the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.45,0:35:51.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,On to the Grand Line!Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.00,0:35:54.22,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:36.09,Secondary-480p,,0,0,53,,Take this board off!! You bastard!!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:39.16,Secondary-480p,,0,0,53,,Take it off!! You liar!Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:40.35,Secondary-480p,,0,0,53,,You stupid head!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:25.31,Secondary-480p,,0,0,53,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.31,0:15:26.52,Secondary-480p,,0,0,53,,This is heavy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.38,Secondary-480p,,0,0,53,,Phew, lucky me.Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.38,0:16:41.89,Secondary-480p,,0,0,53,,I was worried for a moment.Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.17,0:19:23.32,Secondary-480p,,0,0,0,,We're gonna make it toDialogue: 0,0:19:23.30,0:19:23.97,Secondary-480p,,0,0,0,,the Grand Line like this!Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.11,0:32:52.53,Secondary-480p,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, I knew it!Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.35,0:00:06.77,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,An elephant bluefin tuna, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.77,0:00:09.90,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! I can't wait to cook it!Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:50.25,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,So he just walked right up to it... Just wait, you brat.Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:09.51,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,If I could just cut down the platform...Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:36.99,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Why did he smile?Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:40.47,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Did he know he'd be saved?Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:47.37,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,No. In that moment, he genuinely  thought his life was over.Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:52.13,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,He accepted death and smiled like he was ready.Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.67,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Editing FeesoDialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:15.67,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Timing KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:01:15.67,0:01:19.67,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Quality Control Feeso Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack SewilDialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:21.67,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:23.67,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Graphics DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:25.67,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:27.67,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Translation Gaijin FUNimationDialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:06.16,Title-480p,,0,0,0,,The Legend Has BegunDialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wealth, fame, power...Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:15.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the king of the pirates,Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.59,0:01:17.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,obtained everything the world had to offer.Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:21.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,His final words lured all sorts of adventurers to the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:25.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,My treasure?  It's yours, if you can find it.Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.47,0:01:29.18,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Everything is right where I left it!Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:36.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now pirates head for the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams!Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.27,0:01:37.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The world has entered...Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:39.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,the Great Pirate Era!Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.57,0:01:40.02,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.02,0:01:40.27,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.62,0:01:40.02,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.02,0:01:44.86,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.67,0:01:44.61,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,We'Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.61,0:01:44.91,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,We'Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.72,0:01:44.66,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,re goDialogue: 2,0:01:44.66,0:01:44.96,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,re goDialogue: 1,0:01:39.77,0:01:44.71,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,ingDialogue: 2,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.01,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,ingDialogue: 1,0:01:39.82,0:01:44.76,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx, toDialogue: 2,0:01:44.76,0:01:45.06,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx, toDialogue: 1,0:01:39.87,0:01:44.81,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx, gaDialogue: 2,0:01:44.81,0:01:45.11,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx, gaDialogue: 1,0:01:39.92,0:01:44.86,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,thDialogue: 2,0:01:44.86,0:01:45.16,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,thDialogue: 1,0:01:39.97,0:01:44.91,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,erDialogue: 2,0:01: